			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210000301,
					"content": "こ…こんなこともあるなんて…心臓が止まるかと思った…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "モン"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000302,
					"content": "#ありがとう、{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}。先に進もう…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "モン"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000303,
					"content": "えっ？ボ…ボクの漂流瓶は？さっきまで持ってたのに、ない！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "モン"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000304,
					"content": "もしかして、さっきあの…あのトリックフラワーに襲われたとき、どっかに落ちちゃったの？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210000305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "モン"
				},
				{
					"id": 210000305,
					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}、一緒に探してくれない？お願い。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "モン"
				}
			]
		},
		{
